ound\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20061211004207&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lump_of_Cake_Dough_160cfd.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a lump of cake dough.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>If you mix a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a> or trough of <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">milk</a> with <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">flour</a> you will get a Lump of cake dough. If you use it on an oven you will receive <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cake</a>. If you use it on any oven at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Bakery\">Christmas Bakery</a> (and if you know the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Recipe\">Gingerbread Recipe</a>) you can bake a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadman</a> instead. If you use it on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a> you will get a Baking Tray (Cookie) use any oven to get 12 Cookies.<br/>\nIt looks the same as a Lump of Reed Flour Dough.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>In a small patch on 10 November 2009 its weight was changed from 5.00 oz to 1.00 oz.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a></li><li>Baking Tray (Cookie)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">Bucket</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Cake (Decorated)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\">Chocolate Cake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Bakery\">Christmas Bakery</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookie</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li>Event Creatures</li><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Recipe\">Gingerbread Recipe</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadman</a></li><li>Grass</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li>Lump of Reed Flour Dough</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li>Party Cake</li><li>Party Items</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a></li><li>Rookgaard Food</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest</a></li><li>Trough</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","threatened-dreams-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","quest":"The Hidden City of Beregar Quest","step":"3-1","n":22,"title":"Fazer o Chocolate Cake","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"threatened-dreams-quest","quest":"Threatened Dreams Quest","step":"7-6","n":71,"title":"Fazer a massa de chocolate","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"drops":[{"creature":"Grynch Clan Goblin","pct":4.903,"qty":"1","rarity":"semi-raro","hp":"80","exp":"4","loc":"They do not have a set respawn spot. They are announced to be stealing presents from a random Tibian city and spawn in the aforetold city. There are two or three messages that appear on each raid and three massive spawns of goblins.","places":[{"name":"Raid","x":32220,"y":31145,"z":7,"href":"#/wiki/Raid"}],"href":"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin"}]}}